## Ownership model

```yaml
ownership:
  brain_master_owns:
    - "HacedleKernel trait definition  (kernel/hacedle.rs)"
    - "CE injection into ZeusRouter"
    - "LoadedModel lifecycle (open/close)"
    - "KvCache lifecycle (alloc/reset)"

  hacedle_owns:
    - "ALL tensor ops (rmsnorm, rope, silu, attention, matmul)"
    - "GGUF parsing (loader_std, header, tensor_index)"
    - "Candle forward pass (embed, layer, lmhead)"
    - "Dequantization (dequant/q4_k.rs)"
    - "Memory-mapped tensor access (mmap.rs, tensor_projection.rs)"

  rule: "brain/master calls hacedle. hacedle never imports brain/master."
```

