## Attention GAP-02 dependency

```yaml
attention_fix_required: |
  fem/hacedle/src/ops/attention.rs::attention_weighted_sum()
  has 'let output' (immutable) â€” always returns zeros.
  
  Fix: 'let mut output' + uncomment assignment.
  
  This BLOCKS layer.rs forward() from producing correct hidden states.
  HacedleKernel.forward() will produce garbage logits until fixed.
  
  Priority: fix BEFORE wiring kernel bridge.
  Effort: 10 minutes â€” single 'mut' keyword.
```
